This licence covers Chippie's own source code. Files under assets/,
web/hosted-roms/ and third_party/, and the ROMs Chippie downloads, have their
own origins and terms, listed in assets/LICENSES.md.

The TV artwork (assets/tv/) was AI-generated using Google Gemini and is free
to use and distribute. Because AI-generated images lack copyright under US
law, it is believed to be in the public domain and is distributed here
without copyright restrictions.
